data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"The repo is empty except for an initial commit. I need to design the interface. The design should use @codesweep-ai/ui with Header, Footer, Button, and colour tokens.\n\nI should first check if the design system package exists / what it offers. But as orchestrator, I shouldn't necessarily need to install it. The developer will install it. However, I should create a DESIGN.md with the design decisions.\n\nLet me think about the design:\n- A simple React + Vite app\n- Header and Footer from @codesweep-ai/ui's AppShell\n- Greeting text in the center\n- Buttons to change greeting colour\n- Use @codesweep-ai/ui colour tokens for greeting colours\n\nI need to decide:\n- Greeting wording: \"Hello, world!\" or \"Welcome to Codesweep\"\n- Colours: pick from the design system tokens - maybe primary, success, warning, danger, etc.\n- Layout: centered vertically and horizontally\n- Button labels: name of colours\n\nI don't know the exact token names without looking at the package. Let me check if the package is available somewhere or if I can inspect it. Actually, I could create a temporary npm project to inspect the catalog. But maybe simpler: the developer brief says to read catalog.json at node_modules/@codesweep-ai/ui/catalog.json. I don't have it installed yet.\n\nActually, as orchestrator, I can make reasonable design choices and name tokens generically. But to be accurate, I should probably install the package temporarily to see the tokens. Let me do that in /tmp to inspect.\n\nActually, let me think - the orchestrator brief says \"Name design system components in that file rather than colours and pixels. The mission already requires a `Header`, a `Footer`, its `Button` and its colour tokens, so your design says how those fit together and what else it takes from the catalog.\"\n\nSo I need to reference components from the catalog. I should inspect the catalog. Let me create a temp directory, install the package, and read catalog.json and maybe the d.ts files to understand what's available."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789848983,"id":"chatcmpl-a342499dcd504f6693b6ebd246001c74","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

